WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.767
-We're all so excited that the
Olympics are here.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:03.901
And of course we're pumped for
all the big events.

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.234
But there's one event that
doesn't always

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:06.567
get the most attention.

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:07.601
Until now.

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.167
Take a look.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.133
♪♪

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:12.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:15.901
-♪ You think that all Olympic
sports are glory golden fame ♪

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:17.267
♪ They're not ♪
-♪ But there is one ♪

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.367
♪ That stands above
that isn't playing games ♪

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:20.501
-♪ No more games ♪

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:21.868
♪ Forget the slopes,
forget the ice ♪

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.634
♪ No, I'm not in the mood ♪
-♪ Not tonight ♪

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:26.033
-♪ Because I want
to sing about tonight ♪

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:27.434
♪ Is doubles luge ♪

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:29.200
-♪ Two birds one sled ♪

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.000
♪ Try to stay alive ♪

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.868
♪ Bodysuit skin tight ♪

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:33.934
♪ Spooning while we drive ♪

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:34.934
-♪ Spooning ♪

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.367
-♪ First sprint then slide ♪

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:38.167
♪ The hard work never ends ♪

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:39.968
♪ We shoot through
all the tubes ♪

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:41.033
♪ Just like a colon cleanse ♪

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.033
-♪ Oh, wow ♪

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.601
-♪ Flying fast, making turns ♪

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.501
♪ In sync with my teammate ♪

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:47.334
♪ I whisper in his ear ♪

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.167
♪ You're really doing great ♪

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:50.834
♪ Milliseconds for the win ♪

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:52.167
♪ We simply cannot lose ♪

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:54.567
-♪ Don't lose ♪
-♪ Pelvis on pelvis ♪

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.801
♪ That is doubles luge ♪

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:58.334
-♪ Again ♪
-♪ Pelvis on pelvis ♪

00:00:58.334 --> 00:00:59.834
♪ That is doubles luge ♪

